      "side": 1,
      "message": "is this correct? I was suggesting we write a test to determine this, not necessarily change the logic, e.g. extending or a similar test to [`TestArchProperties`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/android/arch_test.go;l\u003d587;drc\u003df05b0d35d2fbe51be9961ce8ce8031f840295c68) that uses `variant_prepend`",
