      "writtenOn": "2022-12-19T21:44:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@eakammer@google.com, WDYM by \"this\" in \"is **this** correct\"? Are you asking whether `the internal order of the \u0027select\u0027 props should not be impacted` is true?\n\n@mrziwang@google.com, when you say `the internal order of the \u0027select\u0027 props should not be impacted`, do you mean that order of varaints as written in the `bp` file should be preserved? I.e. for\n```\ncc_library {\n   name: \"a\",\n   srcs: [\"a.cpp\"],\n   export_include_dirs: [\"export_include_dirs\"],\n   export_system_include_dirs: [\"export_system_include_dirs\"],\n     target: {\n       android: {\n         export_include_dirs: [\"android_export_include_dirs\"],\n         export_system_include_dirs: [\"android_export_system_include_dirs\"],\n       },\n     },\n     arch: {\n       arm: {\n         export_include_dirs: [\"arm_export_include_dirs\"],\n         export_system_include_dirs: [\"arm_export_system_include_dirs\"],\n       },\n     }\n}\n```\nthe `os:android` contraints should come before the `arch:arm` constraints?\n\nOr do you mean something else?",
      "parentUuid": "e344967e_d2c62265",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 45
      },
      "revId": "52a8ab9548c408ea0f22e758dde43a124a9ac504",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "08d3ea2b_a1cc0b1d",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 2
