      "writtenOn": "2022-12-19T21:46:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not asking whether this describes the implementation or whether the bp2build tests are correct, but what the *correct* ordering of the selects should be based on Soong\u0027s own logic.\n\ne.g. in your test TestCcLibraryVariantPrependPropOrder,\n\nfor android_arm, your test would result in:\n\n```\n\"lib32_export_include_dirs\",\n\"arm_export_include_dirs\",\n\"android_export_include_dirs\",\n\"android_arm_export_include_dirs\",\n\"export_include_dirs\"\n```\n\nis that the ordering Soong would produce for android_arm, or would it be fully inverted as you had before:\n\n\n```\n\"android_arm_export_include_dirs\",\n\"android_export_include_dirs\",\n\"lib32_export_include_dirs\",\n\"arm_export_include_dirs\",\n\"export_include_dirs\"\n```\n\nAs mentioned above, we should write a Soong test to determine the ordering of libraries that Soong would produce and then update the handling of prepend for attribute creation if necessary.",
      "parentUuid": "cd92d828_e8e946ec",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 45
      },
      "revId": "52a8ab9548c408ea0f22e758dde43a124a9ac504",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
