      "writtenOn": "2022-12-20T17:47:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@delmerico@google.com Not the variants order in bp file. AFAIK it\u0027s this: Without this `variant_prepend` feature, the order you see in selects should be the same as the order in selects after this `variant_prepend` feature is added. e.g.\n\nIf in the BUILD.bazel is something like this without this feature:\n`export_includes \u003d [a, b, c] + select({d, e, f})`\nAfter this feature it should be:\n`export_includes \u003d select({d, e, f}) + [a, b, c]`",
      "parentUuid": "08d3ea2b_a1cc0b1d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 45
